Package: libaccountsservice0
Version: @DEB_ACCOUNTSSERVICE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/AccountsService/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libpolkit-gobject-1-0
Description: Query and manipulate user account information (client library)
 The libaccountsservice client library for rootless iOS. gnome-shell imports
 gi://AccountsService in its panel boot path, so this library (and its on-device
 generated AccountsService-1.0 typelib) is required for the shell to start. The
 Linux accounts-daemon is not built; session enumeration uses a single-session
 sd-login shim. The org.freedesktop.Accounts data comes from a stub daemon or the
 shell degrades to an empty user name.
